\newlabel{tab:finalbudget}{{7}{11}{Final-checkpoint sensitivity: mean $\pm $ sample standard deviation across the original three seeds. Context gain is in nats per target. These checkpoints match training exposure exactly, whereas validation selection can retain earlier weights. Main results and inference continue to use validation-selected models}{table.7}{}}
